  "identity": {
    "text": "No. The announcement has changed our platform to eight. I'm standing beside the stairs.\n\nIt is running fifteen minutes late. The display now says ten forty-five.\n\nYes. Staff are checking a signal beside the track near North Junction. They cannot say when it will be ready.\n\nYes. The conductor says the eleven o'clock service goes directly to the coast. We won't need a transfer.\n\nYes, but our seat reservation is not. We can ask for new seats at the desk.\n\nThere are two seats together in carriage five. The fare is the same, so we don't need to pay extra.\n\nTwelve ten. I'll message our friend now. She is meeting us outside the station.\n\nThe terminal has an indoor waiting room. She can wait there and come outside when our train arrives.\n\nJust water. Please meet me by the stairs at ten fifty. We should allow ten minutes to get to the right carriage.",
